@startuml
title UC-04 - Inspect and Register Connection
actor "Platform Engineer / Admin" as PE
boundary ConnectionController as API
control ConnectionService as Service
control KubeconfigParser as Parser
boundary KubernetesConnectionVerifier as K8s
boundary AWSConnectionVerifier as AWS
boundary ConnectionCredentialStore as Secrets
database ConnectionRepository as Repo
PE -> API: Inspect kubeconfig [MS-01..03, VAR-01]
API -> Service: InspectKubeconfig(org, document)
Service -> Parser: Parse supported contexts
Parser --> Service: safe context/cluster/endpoint metadata
Service --> API: metadata only (no write/network)
API --> PE: select context + review destination
PE -> API: Check and save [MS-04]
alt Kubernetes [VAR-01, first delivery]
  API -> Service: RegisterKubeconfig(org, name, document, context)
  Service -> Parser: Revalidate + normalize selected context
  Parser --> Service: selected config (request memory)
  Service -> K8s: Verify(config), no resource creation [MS-05]
  K8s --> Service: safe VerificationResult
else AWS [VAR-02, future delivery]
  API -> Service: RegisterAWSDriverAccount(org, command)
  Service -> AWS: Verify(identity, regions, backend, provisioning permissions)
  AWS --> Service: safe VerificationResult
end
Service -> Service: Generate unique key from name
Service -> Secrets: Put(org, key, immutable attempt, credential) [MS-06]
Secrets --> Service: opaque reference
Service -> Repo: CreateConnection(READY) <<transaction>> [MS-07]
alt Insert succeeds
  Repo --> Service: committed Connection
  Service --> API: public metadata DTO [MS-08..09]
  API --> PE: Registered; clear credential; reload list
else Insert fails
  Repo --> Service: failure
  Service -> Secrets: Delete only own attempt (bounded cleanup)
  Service --> API: safe failure; report cleanup error if any
  API --> PE: Registration failed
end
note right of Repo
No overwrite on collision/concurrency.
Organization default is unchanged.
No secret bytes in logical state.
end note
PE -> API: Register Secret Store Connection [SS-01..06]
API -> Service: Role/org-gated Vault register command
Service -> Service: Verify KV v2/capabilities, cleanup own probe
Service -> Secrets: Put scoped immutable store token
Service -> Repo: Insert separate SecretStoreConnection READY
Service --> PE: Safe metadata, never token/ref
@enduml
